{"id":6162,"date":"2021-03-10T19:54:17","date_gmt":"2021-03-10T19:54:17","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=6162"},"modified":"2021-05-31T08:22:38","modified_gmt":"2021-05-31T08:22:38","slug":"archeometrie","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/archeometrie\/","title":{"rendered":"Prvn\u00ed ro\u010dn\u00edk podzimn\u00ed \u0161koly archeometrie"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>R\u00e1di bychom v\u00e1s v t\u00e9to nep\u0159\u00edli\u0161 optimistick\u00e9 dob\u011b p\u0159izvali k t\u011b\u0161en\u00ed se na lep\u0161\u00ed \u010dasy: Univerzita Palack\u00e9ho v Olomouci po\u0159\u00e1d\u00e1 ve dnech <strong>9. &#8211; 10. z\u00e1\u0159\u00ed 2021<\/strong> prvn\u00ed ro\u010dn\u00edk podzimn\u00ed \u0161koly <strong>archeometrie<\/strong>. Jedn\u00e1 se o mezioborov\u00e9 setk\u00e1n\u00ed v\u011bdeck\u00fdch pracovn\u00edk\u016f zab\u00fdvaj\u00edc\u00edch se r\u016fzn\u00fdmi obory v r\u00e1mci pr\u00e1ce s archeologick\u00fdmi n\u00e1lezy.<\/p>\n<p>U\u017e\u00edt si m\u016f\u017eete nejen <a href=\"http:\/\/archeometrie2021.upol.cz\/index.php?link=programme\">program<\/a> pln\u00fd zaj\u00edmav\u00fdch p\u0159edn\u00e1\u0161ek, ale tak\u00e9 \u0159adu workshop\u016f, spole\u010densk\u00fd ve\u010der i p\u0159\u00edjemnou atmosf\u00e9ru podzimn\u00ed Olomouce. <a href=\"http:\/\/archeometrie2021.upol.cz\/index.php?link=registration\">Registrovat<\/a> se m\u016f\u017eete do 31. kv\u011btna 2021.<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone wp-image-6163 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/03\/b24c28dc.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"3976\" height=\"780\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/03\/b24c28dc.png 3976w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/03\/b24c28dc-300x59.png 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/03\/b24c28dc-1024x201.png 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/03\/b24c28dc-768x151.png 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/03\/b24c28dc-1536x301.png 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/03\/b24c28dc-2048x402.png 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 3976px) 100vw, 3976px\" \/><\/p>\n<blockquote><p><i>V sou\u010dasn\u00e9 dob\u011b je spolupr\u00e1ce nap\u0159\u00ed\u010d nejr\u016fzn\u011bj\u0161\u00edmi obory z\u00e1sadn\u00ed pro z\u00edsk\u00e1n\u00ed ucelen\u00e9ho spektra informac\u00ed. V p\u0159\u00edpad\u011b, kdy doch\u00e1z\u00ed k propojen\u00ed humanitn\u00edch a p\u0159\u00edrodov\u011bdn\u00fdch obor\u016f, m\u016f\u017ee nastat tzv. informa\u010dn\u00ed \u0161um a lid\u00e9 se navz\u00e1jem nepochop\u00ed. Jednodu\u0161e \u2013 ka\u017ed\u00fd m\u00e1me sv\u016fj styl vyjad\u0159ov\u00e1n\u00ed ovlivn\u011bn na\u0161\u00edm oborem.<\/i><\/p>\n<p><i>Z tohoto d\u016fvodu jsme se rozhodli uspo\u0159\u00e1dat I. ro\u010dn\u00edk podzimn\u00ed \u0161koly archeometrie, kter\u00e1 by m\u011bla slou\u017eit v prv\u00e9 \u0159ad\u011b k vz\u00e1jemn\u00e9mu vzd\u011bl\u00e1v\u00e1n\u00ed se, pochopen\u00ed, pro\u010d ten d\u011bl\u00e1 v\u011bci tak a jin\u00fd zase onak a jak\u00fdmi z\u00e1sahy mohu p\u0159edm\u011bt po\u0161kodit\/kontaminovat pro dal\u0161\u00ed anal\u00fdzy. V neposledn\u00ed \u0159ad\u011b by m\u011bla tato \u201e\u0161kola\u201c slou\u017eit k vz\u00e1jemn\u00e9mu setk\u00e1n\u00ed za \u00fa\u010delem \u0159e\u0161en\u00ed aktu\u00e1ln\u00edch v\u011bdeck\u00fdch problem\u016f z t\u00e9to oblasti v\u00fdzkumu.<\/i><\/p><\/blockquote>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>R\u00e1di bychom v\u00e1s v t\u00e9to nep\u0159\u00edli\u0161 optimistick\u00e9 dob\u011b p\u0159izvali k t\u011b\u0161en\u00ed se na lep\u0161\u00ed \u010dasy: Univerzita Palack\u00e9ho v Olomouci po\u0159\u00e1d\u00e1 ve dnech 9. &#8211; 10. z\u00e1\u0159\u00ed 2021 prvn\u00ed ro\u010dn\u00edk podzimn\u00ed \u0161koly archeometrie. Jedn\u00e1 se o mezioborov\u00e9 setk\u00e1n\u00ed v\u011bdeck\u00fdch pracovn\u00edk\u016f zab\u00fdvaj\u00edc\u00edch se r\u016fzn\u00fdmi ob